  "prefLabel": "Lab 1505.01 Adding or Terminating Clients",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-11-04",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lab 1505.01 Adding or Terminating Clients. The licensee shall submit to the department updated information on new and terminated client companies within the state of New Hampshire within 20 business days of such event by completing and filing “Notification of Employee Leasing Company Client Addition or Termination” form 6WC-LE, Rev.08/2022 . A client company shall be considered “new” if it commences to be subject to New Hampshire labor laws, regardless whether the client was previously a client of the licensee in another jurisdiction.\n\nSource. #6626, eff 11-4-97, EXPIRED: 11-4-05\n\nNew. #10221, eff 11-3-12; ss by #13440, eff 8-24-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lab1500.html"
